  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Air Transport Sector Development (SATSD) in the Eastern Africa, Southern Africa and Indian Ocean Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is to contribute to the development of the air transport sector in the EA-SA-IO region. The specific objectives are 1. Operationalisation of a Single African Air Transport Market 2. Strengthening of regulatory and institutional capacity of civil aviation institutions in EA- SA-IO region3. Improved air navigation efficiency in the EA-SA-IO regionThese objectives will contribute and complement the continental objectives of the AU. The programme will therefore incorporate regional, continental and global initiatives intended to support air transport sector development to maximise the benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
